# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Here is a quantum circuit implementation of the teleportation protocol.\n"
msgstr ""
"Narito ang isang implementasyon ng teleportation protocol gamit ang quantum "
"circuit.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
