msgstr ""
"Kapag $(x,y) = (0,0),$ pumipili sina Alice at Bob ng $\\alpha = 0$ at "
"$\\beta = \\pi/8,$ at sa pamamagitan ng pagsasama ng kanilang mga basis "
"nakukuha natin ang figure na ito:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Alice and Bob bases case 1](/learning/images/courses/basics-of-quantum-"
"information/entanglement-in-action/qiskit-implementation/strategy00.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Alice and Bob bases case 1](/learning/images/courses/basics-of-quantum-"
"information/entanglement-in-action/qiskit-implementation/strategy00.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The angle between the red vectors is $\\pi/8,$ which is the same as the angle between the two blue vectors.\n"
"The probability that Alice and Bob's outcomes agree is the cosine-squared of this angle,\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang anggulo sa pagitan ng mga pulang vector ay $\\pi/8,$ na kapareho ng anggulo sa pagitan ng dalawang asul na vector.\n"
"Ang probabilidad na magkaayon ang mga kinalabasan ni Alice at Bob ay ang cosine-squared ng anggulóng ito,\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\cos^2\\Bigl(\\frac{\\pi}{8}\\Bigr) = \\frac{2 + \\sqrt{2}}{4},\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\cos^2\\Bigl(\\frac{\\pi}{8}\\Bigr) = \\frac{2 + \\sqrt{2}}{4},\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "while the probability they disagree is the sine-squared of this angle,\n"
msgstr ""
