"nakukuha natin ang figure na ito:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Alice and Bob bases case 1](/learning/images/courses/basics-of-quantum-"
"information/entanglement-in-action/qiskit-implementation/strategy01.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Alice and Bob bases case 1](/learning/images/courses/basics-of-quantum-"
"information/entanglement-in-action/qiskit-implementation/strategy01.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The angle between the red vectors is again $\\pi/8,$ as is the angle between the blue vectors.\n"
"The probability that Alice and Bob's outcomes agree is again the cosine-squared of this angle,\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang anggulo sa pagitan ng mga pulang vector ay muli $\\pi/8,$ tulad ng anggulo sa pagitan ng mga asul na vector.\n"
"Ang probabilidad na magkaayon ang mga kinalabasan ni Alice at Bob ay muli ang cosine-squared ng anggulóng ito,\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When $(x,y) = (1,0),$ Alice and Bob choose $\\alpha = \\pi/4$ and $\\beta = "
"\\pi/8,$ and by superimposing their bases we obtain this figure:\n"
msgstr ""
"Kapag $(x,y) = (1,0),$ pumipili sina Alice at Bob ng $\\alpha = \\pi/4$ at "
"$\\beta = \\pi/8,$ at sa pamamagitan ng pagsasama ng kanilang mga basis "
"nakukuha natin ang figure na ito:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Alice and Bob bases case 1](/learning/images/courses/basics-of-quantum-"
"information/entanglement-in-action/qiskit-implementation/strategy10.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Alice and Bob bases case 1](/learning/images/courses/basics-of-quantum-"
"information/entanglement-in-action/qiskit-implementation/strategy10.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The bases have changed but the angles haven't — once again the angle between vectors of the same color is $\\pi/8.$\n"
"The probability that Alice and Bob's outcomes agree is\n"
msgstr ""
"Nagbago ang mga basis ngunit hindi ang mga anggulo — muli ang anggulo sa pagitan ng mga vector na magkaparehong kulay ay $\\pi/8.$\n"
"Ang probabilidad na magkaayon ang mga kinalabasan ni Alice at Bob ay\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "and the probability they disagree is\n"
msgstr "at ang probabilidad na hindi sila magkaayon ay\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When $(x,y) = (1,1),$ Alice and Bob choose $\\alpha = \\pi/4$ and $\\beta = "
"-\\pi/8.$ When we superimpose their bases, we see that something different "
"has happened:\n"
msgstr ""
"Kapag $(x,y) = (1,1),$ pumipili sina Alice at Bob ng $\\alpha = \\pi/4$ at "
